{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "root",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# 创作意图结构化研究｜L1\n\n## 核心问题\n1. 别人怎么把创作意图结构化？\n2. 十元到底补在哪一层？\n3. 十元是否比普通 Intent Graph 有增量？\n\n**5 轮研究**\nR1→R2→R3→R4→R5\n\n状态：OPEN / R1 READY"
    },
    {
      "id": "routeA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1450,
      "y": -720,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "# A｜Attribute / Taxonomy\n\n意图 → 属性变量\nitem / silhouette / color / material / style\n\n强：WHAT\n弱：关系 / 主次 / 动态"
    },
    {
      "id": "routeB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -780,
      "y": -720,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# B｜Concept Graph\n\nToMigo\nNode = purpose/content/style\nEdge = interpretable relation\n\n**与 IRG 最近的社会 baseline**"
    },
    {
      "id": "routeC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1450,
      "y": -180,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 410,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# C｜Intent / Reasoning Canvas\n\nDesignerlyLoop\nproblem framing\nconstraints\nstrategies\nevaluation criteria\nreasoning\n\n意图 = 可持续编辑对象"
    },
    {
      "id": "routeD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -780,
      "y": -180,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "# D｜Evolving Intent Loop\n\nCreative Intention Loop\n↕\nExecution Loop\n↕\nOutput / Feedback\n\nIntent 会随过程变化"
    },
    {
      "id": "routeE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1110,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# E｜Cross-stage Constraint Artifact\n\nRequirements\n→ Concept\n→ Evaluation\n→ Production\n\n核心：\n防 semantic decay / constraint drift"
    },
    {
      "id": "layers",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -180,
      "y": -740,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "# 社会已有的 5 层\n\nL1 WHAT｜属性\nL2 CONNECT｜概念关系\nL3 WHY｜推理/理由\nL4 CHANGE｜意图演化\nL5 SURVIVE｜跨阶段保持\n\n⚠️ “结构化意图”本身已经不是新点"
    },
    {
      "id": "tenyuan",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": -720,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 540,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# 十元的候选位置\n\n**不是整个 Intent Structure**\n而更可能是：\n## Creative Intent Relation Grammar\n\n生 / 克 / 补\n→ Typed Relation\n\n主 / 次\n→ Priority / Hierarchy\n\n体量 / 强度\n→ Relation Weight\n\n动态链\n→ Temporal Relation Transition\n\n起点→变化→终点\n→ Intent State Transition"
    },
    {
      "id": "notnode",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": -80,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# 十元不该替代什么\n\nGoal\nObject\nConstraint\nAttribute\nReference\nStage\nEvidence\n\n这些继续用普通字段。\n\n十元优先研究 **edge / relation / transition**，不要把所有东西硬塞成十元。"
    },
    {
      "id": "baseline",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 430,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "# 真正公平的 Baseline\n\nB0｜Natural Language\nB1｜Attribute / Taxonomy\nB2｜Concept Graph\nB3｜Generic Intent Graph\nGoal + Constraint + Choice\n+ Priority + Rationale + Dynamic Trace\nB4｜Ten-Yuan Relation Graph\nB3 + 生克补 + 主次 + 强度 + 动态链\n\n**真正问题：B4 是否稳定优于 B3？**"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# R1｜现有方法谱系｜DONE\n\n15 个代表系统\n→ 6 个功能家族\n\n输出：\n社会已有结构总谱\n\n**DONE**"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 190,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# R2｜Schema 字段拆解｜DONE\n\n14 字段统一矩阵\n15 个社会方法同表比较\n\n输出：\n成熟字段 / 可能 GAP / Generic Intent Graph v0.1\n\n**DONE**"
    },
    {
      "id": "r3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 730,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# R3｜十元映射｜DONE\n\n结论：\n端点 = Semantic Annotation\n生克补 = Typed Effect Relation\n主次 = Structural Dominance\nT/M/E/C 分离\n动态链 = Relation Transition Candidate\n五轴/五维退出\n\n**DONE**"
    },
    {
      "id": "r4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1270,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "# R4｜GAP / 新增性审计｜DONE\n\nA 生克补 → SPECIALIZATION ONLY\nB 主次+T/E → IMPLEMENTATION VALUE\nC Relation Transition → DOMAIN GAP CANDIDATE\n\n唯一保留：\nDecision-Grounded Dynamic Intent Relation\n\n**DONE**"
    },
    {
      "id": "r5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1810,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# R5｜验证设计｜READY\n\nB0 Natural Language\nB1 Attribute\nB2 Static Concept Graph\nB3 Generic Dynamic Intent Graph\nB4 Ten-Yuan Dynamic Relation Layer\n\n验证：\nACCEPT / REWORK / REJECT\n约束保留/牺牲\nrelation transition\n跨项目泛化\n\n**唯一问题：B4 是否仍优于强 B3？**"
    },
    {
      "id": "routefile",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "AI问题解决Canvas/创作意图结构化研究_L1_研究路线.md",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1570,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "three_dirs_context",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2500,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# 三个论文方向｜上位背景\n\n① 创作主权 / 个性\nAI 无限生产力下，如何保持“我”\n\n② 审美判断 / 最终否决权\n前三层都过，为什么最后仍 REJECT\n\n③ 创作意图 / 灵感架构\n怎样把“我为什么这样创作”结构化给 AI\n\n**当前 L1 专门深挖③，但必须保留①②作为上游。**"
    },
    {
      "id": "dir1_context",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2500,
      "y": -20,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "# 方向1｜WHY\n创作主权 / 个性\n\n个人风格\n选择习惯\n审美判断\n创作意志\n最终决定权"
    },
    {
      "id": "dir2_context",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2500,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# 方向2｜JUDGE\n审美判断 / 最终否决权\n\nL1 技术正确\n→ L2 约束保持\n→ L3 意图符合\n→ L4 创作者最终决策"
    },
    {
      "id": "dir3_context",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2500,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "# 方向3｜REPRESENT｜当前研究焦点\n创作意图 / 灵感架构\n\nGoal / Relation / Priority / Constraint\nRationale / Dynamic Trace\n\n问题：如何让 AI 持续理解“我为什么这样创作”？"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1_result_file",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "AI问题解决Canvas/创作意图结构化研究_R1_现有方法谱系.md",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 1990,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1_taxonomy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# R1 DONE｜社会已有方法谱系\n\n15 个代表系统 → 6 类\n\nA｜Prompt refinement / traceability\nB｜Multimodal / context elicitation\nC｜Attribute / dimension / taxonomy\nD｜Atomic intent units / tags\nE｜Semantic / concept / reasoning graph\nF｜Evolving / cross-stage continuity\n\n## 关键社会 baseline\nToMigo → Relation / Graph\nAHP → Weight / Priority\nDesignerlyLoop → Rationale / Dynamic Intent\nCreative Dialogue → Evolving Intent\nGID-HGCC → Cross-stage Constraint\n\n**结论：Node / Edge / Weight / Reasoning / Time / Stage / Trace 都已有人做。**"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1_tenyuan_gate",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 1940,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 540,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# R1 给十元留下的硬问题\n\n生克补\n≠ 只证明“我有 relation”\n→ 必须区别于 ToMigo supportive edge\n\n主次 / 体量\n≠ 只证明“我有 weight”\n→ 必须区别于 AHP / Priority\n\n动态链\n≠ 只证明“我的 intent 会变化”\n→ 必须区别于 Evolving Intent Loop\n\n**R3/R4 才判断：换名字，还是有新增操作能力。**"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2_result_file",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "AI问题解决Canvas/创作意图结构化研究_R2_Schema字段矩阵.md",
      "x": 190,
      "y": 1570,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2_schema",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 1540,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 650,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# R2 DONE｜统一 Schema\n\n14 字段：\nNode / Edge / Relation Type / Direction\nPriority / Weight / Constraint / Rationale\nState / Transition / Stage / Evidence\nEditability / Propagation\n\n## 已高度成熟\nNode / basic Edge / Direction / Constraint\nState / Stage / Editability / basic Propagation\n\n## 仍值得追\n1. Typed relational effect\n2. Conflict priority\n3. Relation transition\n4. Decision-grounded rationale"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2_ten_scope",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 1540,
      "width": 690,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# R2 对十元的收缩\n\n十元不再竞争：\n**整个 Creative Intent Structure**\n\n普通 Schema 负责：\nGoal / Object / Constraint / Attribute\nStage / Evidence\n\n十元只竞争：\n**Relation Type**\n**Conflict Priority**\n**Relation Strength**\n**Relation Transition**\n\n因此公平基线必须是：\nGeneric Intent Graph\nvs\nTen-Yuan Relation Graph"
    },
    {
      "id": "r3_result_file",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "AI问题解决Canvas/创作意图结构化研究_R3_十元逐项映射.md",
      "x": 730,
      "y": 1570,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "r3_corrections",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1280,
      "y": 2280,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 650,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# R3 DONE｜三个关键修正\n\n1｜主次 ≠ decision priority\n主次 = compositional dominance\n冲突保谁仍需独立 priority / LOCK-FLEX\n\n2｜T / M / E / C 必须分开\nT = 结构占位\nM = 阶段显影\nE = 关系作用量\nC = 证据置信度\n\n3｜十元端点 ≠ Intent Node Type\n十元 = semantic annotation layer"
    },
    {
      "id": "r3_layer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2050,
      "y": 2250,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 700,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "# Ten-Yuan Intent Relation Layer v0.1\n\n挂在 Generic Intent Graph 上，而不是替代它。\n\nNode Annotation\n- ten_yuan_semantic\n- primary / secondary\n- T structural occupancy\n- M stage salience\n- C confidence\n\nTyped Edge\n- 生 / 克 / 补\n- mechanism\n- target_variable\n- E effect magnitude\n\nTemporal Relation\n- continue / reverse / fade / shift\n- new endpoint"
    },
    {
      "id": "r3_outscope",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2850,
      "y": 2290,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# R3｜退出当前论文核心\n\n**五轴 → OUT OF SCOPE**\n高阶十元语义空间 / 五行结构层\n\n**五维 → OUT OF SCOPE**\nNarrative / Theme Layer\n时间 / 本体 / 空间 / 因果 / 命运\n\n不代表没价值；\n只是当前“创作意图关系结构”论文不需要它们。"
    },
    {
      "id": "r3_candidate",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2050,
      "y": 3060,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# 当前唯一 NEW OPERATOR CANDIDATE\n\n## 动态链中的 Relation-Type Transition\n\n不是普通 State0→State1。\n而是：\nRelation0\n→ continue / reverse / fade / shift\n→ Relation1\n\n例如：\n克 → 补 → 反克\n\nR4 必须检查：\n现有 creative intent graph 是否已经有同类第一等操作。"
    },
    {
      "id": "r4_result_file",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "AI问题解决Canvas/创作意图结构化研究_R4_GAP新增性审计.md",
      "x": 1270,
      "y": 1570,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "r4_kill",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2840,
      "y": 3060,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 600,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# R4｜三个“基础原创”主张全部砍掉\n\nA 生克补\n≠ 新 relation primitive\n→ SOCIAL / CAUSAL GRAPH 已有\n\nB 主次 + T/E\n≠ 新 priority / weight\n→ hierarchy / AHP / effect weight 已有\n\nC 动态链\n≠ 新 temporal graph\n→ temporal KG / time cognitive map 已有\n\n**十元不能从图结构本身主张基础创新。**"
    },
    {
      "id": "r4_keep",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3600,
      "y": 3060,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 650,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# R4｜唯一保留候选\n\n## Decision-Grounded Dynamic Intent Relation\n\n不是“关系会变化”本身。\n而是：\n\nCreative Intent A/B 的 relation semantics\nsupport / conflict / compensate / preserve ...\n在真实创作轮次中如何转型\n↓\n是否能预测真实：\n**ACCEPT / REWORK / REJECT**\n\n状态：DOMAIN GAP CANDIDATE"
    },
    {
      "id": "r4_bridge",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3600,
      "y": 3820,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# 方向 3 × 方向 2 接口\n\n③ REPRESENT\n动态意图关系结构\n↓\n冻结预测\n↓\n② JUDGE\n真实创作者决策\nACCEPT / REWORK / REJECT\n↓\nEvidence Delta\n\n**表示是否有用，必须交给真实决策验证。**"
    },
    {
      "id": "r4_tenrole",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4460,
      "y": 3060,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 610,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# 十元最终身份｜R4\n\n不是方法本体。\n而是：\n## Candidate Relation Coding Scheme\n\nB3｜Generic Dynamic Intent Graph\nvs\nB4｜Ten-Yuan Dynamic Relation Layer\n\n若 B4≈B3：\n十元无额外预测价值。\n\n若 B4>B3：\n才保留为有增量的关系编码。"
    }
  ],
